Package: vajra-package-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, apt, dpkg
Description: Vajra OS App Store & Package Manager — 28 curated free apps
 Privacy-first app store that shows app info, pros, cons, and permissions
 BEFORE installation. All apps are free and open source.
 .
 Features:
  * Browse 28 curated apps across 9 categories
  * Search apps by name, description, or category
  * Show app details: description, size, permissions, pros, cons
  * Install/remove apps with privacy confirmation
  * Update all installed packages
  * List all installed packages
 .
 Categories: Office, Graphics, Internet, Media, Developer, System,
 Security, Social, Gaming.
